{
    "title": "Waiter: one date a day",
    "description": "Waiter is the very first dating app to \"detox\" from other dating apps. AND IT'S FREE !!!\r\n\r\nWaiter is a detox app to stop the collection of useless matches that only serve to flatter the ego. Also stops the zapping of thousands of profiles and the many hours lost.\r\n\r\nWaiter relearns the patience to meet \"THE\" right person naturally when the time is right. Because having a real crush takes time and it can happen over time\r\n\r\nTake your time but not on the app because with Waiter it's only one minute a day and no more. Why? Simply because it is in real life that one prepares to match and not by staying on the internet.\r\n\r\nWaiter will thus offer you only 3 profiles per day to meet depending on your attractions and you can only choose one. In order to matches, this person must also choose you... \r\n\r\nAnd then?\r\n\r\nThen you can continue to live, work, see your friends, your family, play sports, travel and take care of YOURSELF! That's a great way to go, isn't it?\r\n\r\nAnd don't worry, whether today, tomorrow or in a month, someone's bound to wait for you on Waiter. It's up to you to choose! \r\n\r\nALREADY OVER 250,000 MATCHES thanks to Waiter more than 2 millions exchanged messages, 45% of which by women.\r\n\r\nSo if you think you are addicted to dating sites or simply disappointed with all of this, it's time to discover Waiter! And if, on the contrary, you are totally resistant to dating sites, you may be surprised by Waiter, which works a bit like in real life by creating \"THE\" unexpected encounter.\r\n\r\nSingles already registered on Waiter have testimonials: no stress using the application, no \"always more\" race, no time lost. But above all, the possibility of \"catching\" the right person without fear that he/she does not see you among thousands of profiles. \r\n\r\nBut for that, you must register and above all complete your profile because a person with a photo is always less chosen than a person who has several photos. And a person with little profile information will be less likely to match based on attractions.\r\n\r\nTell us who you are and we will find the right person for you!\r\n\r\nNO FAKE PROFILES ON WAITER!!!\r\n\r\nWaiter checks the accounts with a selfie to prove that it's really you in the photos. The connection by Facebook Connect is also a security to avoid fake emails. And mandatory geolocation blocks searches from abroad.\r\n\r\nA QUESTION? CONTACT OUR GODMOTHER\r\n\r\nAs soon as you register, our godmother Clo\u00e9 will send you a message and you can contact her at any time by chat. Always kind, she can help you with any questions.\r\n\r\nWaiter is a young startup so don't hesitate to tell us about your great encounters, your support but also your suggestions for improvement. Clo\u00e9 will take care of passing on the info.\r\n\r\nGood luck to you \r\n\r\n\r\nThe Waiter team - www.waiter.love",
